    "decision_rule": "The research question will be considered 'supported' if, after controlling for confounders and applying multiplicity correction, a statistically significant effect (p < adjusted alpha) of own play type X on opponent next-possession PPP is found for a majority of play types, and if the magnitude of these effects meets a predefined practical significance threshold (e.g., a change of at least 0.02 PPP, or a threshold derived from existing 'AVOID' labeling criteria). Similar criteria will apply to 'own-sequence lags'.",
